        </h2>
        <p style="margin:0 0 24px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">
            Formulated for skin that feels tight, parched, and stripped, combining multi-depth humectants with five ceramides and cholesterol to lock in long-lasting moisture.
